      "jcr:created": "Mon Nov 10 2025 15:25:23 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><i>1-minute read</i></span></p>\n<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Digital transformation powered by collaboration</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We’re on a mission to make healthcare better, and partnering with our customers is how we make it happen. At Stryker's second annual Smart Hospital Summit, health system leaders across the country came together for two days of focused collaboration, knowledge sharing and strategic discussions to help shape the new era of the Smart Hospital.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The event featured keynote presentations and breakout sessions exploring the ROI of virtual care, key steps in the Smart Hospital journey and how technologies like AI and ambient monitoring are being implemented to transform care delivery.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">One theme stood out across every conversation: collaboration drives progress.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">“It was truly energizing to connect with our customers and industry leaders at the second annual Smart Hospital Summit,” said Jessica Mathieson, President of Medical at Stryker. “The conversations and insights shared throughout the event highlighted just how powerful collaboration can be as we work together to enhance patient care with digital solutions and technology. I’m grateful to everyone who joined us and contributed to such a meaningful dialogue in an effort to make healthcare better.”</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We’re excited to keep the momentum going as we continue to accelerate innovation and shape what’s next in patient care.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Nov 20 2025 16:33:09 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "bottomMargin": "3"
